{"seq":2,"slug":"argocd-flux","title":"Argo CD 与 Flux 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/gitops/argocd-flux","wordCount":1293,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"argo-cd-与-flux-实战\">Argo CD 与 Flux 实战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Argo CD 和 Flux 是 Kubernetes 生态中两大主流 GitOps 持续交付工具，均为 CNCF 毕业项目。两者都实现了 GitOps 的拉模式，以集群内代理的形式持续监控 Git 仓库，将 Kubernetes 资源的实际状态同步到 Git 中定义的期望状态。尽管目标一致，两者在架构设计、用户体验和扩展能力上存在显著差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Argo CD&#10;        A1[Application CRD] --&gt; B1[Repo Server]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[Git 仓库]&#10;        B1 --&gt; D1[Application Controller]&#10;        D1 --&gt; E1[K8s API Server]&#10;        F1[Web UI / CLI] --&gt; D1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Flux&#10;        A2[GitRepository CRD] --&gt; B2[Source Controller]&#10;        C2[Kustomization CRD] --&gt; D2[Kustomize Controller]&#10;        E2[HelmRelease CRD] --&gt; F2[Helm Controller]&#10;        D2 --&gt; G2[K8s API Server]&#10;        F2 --&gt; G2&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Argo CD\n        A1[Application CRD] --&gt; B1[Repo Server]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[Git 仓库]\n        B1 --&gt; D1[Application Controller]\n        D1 --&gt; E1[K8s API Server]\n        F1[Web UI / CLI] --&gt; D1\n    end\n    subgraph Flux\n        A2[GitRepository CRD] --&gt; B2[Source Controller]\n        C2[Kustomization CRD] --&gt; D2[Kustomize Controller]\n        E2[HelmRelease CRD] --&gt; F2[Helm Controller]\n        D2 --&gt; G2[K8s API Server]\n        F2 --&gt; G2\n    end</pre><p>Argo CD 与 Flux 核心特性对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Argo CD</th>\n<th>Flux</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构风格</td>\n<td>单体应用（多组件）</td>\n<td>微服务（GitOps Toolkit）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI</td>\n<td>内置 Web UI + CLI</td>\n<td>无内置 UI（可集成 Weave GitOps）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多集群管理</td>\n<td>原生支持 Application in any namespace</td>\n<td>通过 KubeConfig Secret 引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置格式</td>\n<td>Kustomize/Helm/Jsonnet/Plain YAML</td>\n<td>Kustomize/Helm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜像自动化</td>\n<td>无内置（需 Argo CD Image Updater）</td>\n<td>内置 Image Automation Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步策略</td>\n<td>手动/自动/窗口控制</td>\n<td>自动同步 + 依赖编排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知集成</td>\n<td>内置通知引擎</td>\n<td>Notification Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RBAC</td>\n<td>内置细粒度 RBAC</td>\n<td>复用 K8s RBAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源管理</td>\n<td>服务端自身较重（3-5 组件）</td>\n<td>较轻量（按需启用控制器）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"argo-cd-架构与部署\">Argo CD 架构与部署</h2><p>Argo CD 由 API Server、Repo Server、Application Controller 和 Dex（SSO）四个核心组件组成。API Server 提供 REST/gRPC 接口和 Web UI，Repo Server 负责从 Git 仓库拉取配置并渲染 Kubernetes 清单，Application Controller 执行状态同步和健康检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Application&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: webapp&#10;  namespace: argocd&#10;spec:&#10;  project: default&#10;  source:&#10;    repoURL: https://github.com/company/gitops-config.git&#10;    targetRevision: main&#10;    path: apps/webapp/overlays/production&#10;  destination:&#10;    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc&#10;    namespace: webapp&#10;  syncPolicy:&#10;    automated:&#10;      prune: true&#10;      selfHeal: true&#10;      allowEmpty: false&#10;    syncOptions:&#10;      - CreateNamespace=true&#10;      - PrunePropagationPolicy=foreground&#10;      - PruneLast=true&#10;    retry:&#10;      limit: 5&#10;      backoff:&#10;        duration: 5s&#10;        factor: 2&#10;        maxDuration: 3m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argocd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    repoURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/company/gitops-config.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    targetRevision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/webapp/overlays/production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://kubernetes.default.svc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  syncPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    automated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      prune</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      selfHeal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      allowEmpty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    syncOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CreateNamespace=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PrunePropagationPolicy=foreground</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PruneLast=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      backoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        maxDuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3m</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Application 是 Argo CD 的核心资源，定义了 Git 仓库路径（Source）到 Kubernetes 集群和命名空间（Destination）的映射关系。<code>syncPolicy.automated</code> 启用自动同步，<code>selfHeal</code> 在检测到手动修改时自动恢复到 Git 定义的状态，<code>prune</code> 自动删除 Git 中已移除的资源。</p>\n<p>ApplicationSet 是 Argo CD 的高级资源，支持从模板批量生成 Application。Generator 机制支持 Git 目录发现、集群列表、矩阵组合和 PR 触发等多种模式。ApplicationSet 特别适合多集群部署和多租户环境，一个 ApplicationSet 可以自动为每个集群或环境生成对应的 Application。</p>\n<p>同步窗口（Sync Window）控制自动同步的时间范围，在维护窗口期外阻止自动部署。结合通知引擎（Notification Engine），Argo CD 可在同步成功、失败或健康状态变化时发送 Slack、Teams 或 Webhook 通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"flux-架构与部署\">Flux 架构与部署</h2><p>Flux 采用微服务架构，由 GitOps Toolkit 中的多个独立控制器组成。Source Controller 管理 Git 仓库和 Helm Chart 仓库的拉取与缓存，Kustomize Controller 应用 Kustomize 渲染后的清单，Helm Controller 管理 Helm Release 的安装和升级，Notification Controller 处理事件分发。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: source.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1&#10;kind: GitRepository&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: gitops-config&#10;  namespace: flux-system&#10;spec:&#10;  interval: 1m&#10;  url: https://github.com/company/gitops-config.git&#10;  ref:&#10;    branch: main&#10;  secretRef:&#10;    name: git-credentials&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1&#10;kind: Kustomization&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: webapp&#10;  namespace: flux-system&#10;spec:&#10;  interval: 5m&#10;  targetNamespace: webapp&#10;  sourceRef:&#10;    kind: GitRepository&#10;    name: gitops-config&#10;  path: ./apps/webapp/overlays/production&#10;  prune: true&#10;  healthChecks:&#10;    - apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;      kind: Deployment&#10;      name: webapp&#10;      namespace: webapp&#10;  dependsOn:&#10;    - name: infrastructure&#10;  timeout: 3m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">source.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GitRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gitops-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flux-system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/company/gitops-config.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  secretRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">git-credentials</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Kustomization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flux-system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  targetNamespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sourceRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GitRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gitops-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./apps/webapp/overlays/production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prune</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  healthChecks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  dependsOn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">infrastructure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3m</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Flux 的依赖编排通过 <code>dependsOn</code> 字段实现 Kustomization 之间的顺序控制。典型场景是先部署基础设施组件（cert-manager、ingress-nginx），等待健康检查通过后再部署应用。这种声明式依赖比 Argo CD 的 Sync Waves（注解方式）更清晰。</p>\n<p>Flux 的镜像自动化功能由 Image Reflector Controller 和 Image Automation Controller 两个组件提供。前者扫描容器镜像仓库中的标签，后者根据策略（SemVer、时间戳、字母排序）自动更新 Git 仓库中的镜像引用。这种 GitOps 原生的镜像更新方式保持了 Git 作为单一可信源的原则。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: image.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1beta2&#10;kind: ImagePolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: webapp&#10;  namespace: flux-system&#10;spec:&#10;  imageRepositoryRef:&#10;    name: webapp&#10;  policy:&#10;    semver:&#10;      range: &#39;&gt;=1.0.0 &lt;2.0.0&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">image.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1beta2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ImagePolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flux-system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  imageRepositoryRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    semver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>=1.0.0 &#x3C;2.0.0'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多集群与多租户管理\">多集群与多租户管理</h2><p>企业环境通常需要管理多个 Kubernetes 集群（开发、测试、预发布、生产、多区域生产），GitOps 工具需要支持集中管理和分散执行的混合模式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管理模式</th>\n<th>Argo CD 实现</th>\n<th>Flux 实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hub-Spoke（集中管理）</td>\n<td>管理集群安装 Argo CD，Application 指向远程集群</td>\n<td>管理集群安装 Flux，通过 KubeConfig Secret 操作远程集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每集群独立</td>\n<td>每个集群安装独立 Argo CD</td>\n<td>每个集群安装独立 Flux</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多租户</td>\n<td>AppProject 限制命名空间和仓库权限</td>\n<td>Kustomization 的 serviceAccountName 和 targetNamespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境促进</td>\n<td>ApplicationSet 模板 + Git 分支/目录</td>\n<td>Kustomization 依赖链 + Flagger</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Argo CD 的 AppProject 是多租户隔离的核心机制，它限制每个团队可访问的 Git 仓库、目标集群和命名空间。结合 RBAC 策略，AppProject 实现了&quot;团队 A 只能在 staging 集群的 team-a 命名空间部署来自 team-a-repo 的应用&quot;等细粒度控制。</p>\n<p>Flux 的多租户模型更贴近 Kubernetes 原生，每个租户在自己的命名空间中创建 GitRepository 和 Kustomization 资源，通过 ServiceAccount 的 RBAC 权限控制资源操作范围。平台团队在 flux-system 命名空间管理基础设施组件，应用团队在各自命名空间管理应用配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Argo CD 提供开箱即用的 Web UI 和丰富功能集，适合需要可视化管理的团队</li>\n<li>Flux 的微服务架构更轻量灵活，原生镜像自动化和声明式依赖编排是独特优势</li>\n<li>ApplicationSet（Argo CD）和 Kustomization 依赖链（Flux）分别解决规模化部署问题</li>\n<li>多集群管理推荐 Hub-Spoke 模式，多租户通过 AppProject 或命名空间 RBAC 隔离</li>\n<li>两者都支持 Kustomize 和 Helm，选择取决于团队对 UI、扩展性和架构偏好的权重</li>\n<li>企业采用通常从一个工具开始标准化，避免同时运维两套 GitOps 系统的管理成本</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Argo CD 与 Flux 实战","id":"argo-cd-与-flux-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Argo CD 架构与部署","id":"argo-cd-架构与部署"},{"level":2,"text":"Flux 架构与部署","id":"flux-架构与部署"},{"level":2,"text":"多集群与多租户管理","id":"多集群与多租户管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GitOps 原则与实践模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/gitops/gitops-principles"},"next":{"title":"GitOps 模式与反模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/gitops/gitops-patterns"}}